### Notifications: notificationList
POST {{function_url}}/api_notifications/notificationList
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "limit": 10,
    "sortBy": "createdAt",
    "sortDirection": "desc",
    "status": "sent",
    "search": "stay_cancelled"
  }
}